@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@authToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_TOKEN
@backupFile = backup.sql

### List backups
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/backups
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Create backup
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/backups
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Upload backup file
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/backups/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ApiBoundary

------ApiBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="backup.sql"
Content-Type: application/sql

< ./backup.sql
------ApiBoundary--

### Validation case missing upload file, expect 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/backups/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ApiBoundary

------ApiBoundary--

### Download backup
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/backups/{{backupFile}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/octet-stream

### Restore backup
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/backups/{{backupFile}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Delete backup
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/backups/{{backupFile}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
